# (0.31) The card left to a full-screen program (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes
# tests/quiet31.keys from this; the card's Programs menu: tests/quiet31.programs; make
# test-31). tests/cardreq.py --count lists the card requests (all tasks) in four windows:
#   10-40 s   the idle Desktop alone: no request at all (print jobs and /Desktop are looked
#             at only after a change on the card: the kernel's count, setting 8)
#   40-56 s   Files, Music, Printer and BASIC opened from the Programs menu (not counted)
#   60-80 s   BASIC runs a full-screen program (SCREEN 1: GCLS 20, a VSYNC loop), the Desktop,
#             Files, Music and Printer behind it: no request at all
#   82 s      Esc: Break, BASIC's window back (the Desktop and Printer: one STAT /PRN: each)
#   85-115 s  idle again with the four windows open: no request at all
40000 move 100 8
40400 click
40900 move 100 24
41300 click
44000 move 100 8
44400 click
44900 move 100 38
45300 click
48000 move 100 8
48400 click
48900 move 100 52
49300 click
52000 move 100 8
52400 click
52900 move 100 66
53300 click
56000 key 10 SCREEN 1:GCLS 20\n20 VSYNC:GOTO 20\nRUN\n
82000 key {esc}
84000 move 300 300
